// The illustrative snippet that motivates the CustomData field omits a
// validate tag entirely (`json:"customData,omitempty"` with nothing
// after it). This golden applies the general optional-composite rule
// instead: every optional composite carries validate:"omitempty", exactly
// like optional_composite.golden's Device field, and CustomData is not a
// special case for tagging — only for which type it names, and for never
// being a generated type.

CustomData *types.CustomData `json:"customData,omitempty" validate:"omitempty"`
